---
source: crates/news/tests/cli.rs
expression: "stdout_of(&[\"run\", \"--help\"])"
---
Chief: preset runs behind /bureau

Usage: news run [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  presets      The preset catalogue
  intent       Map what Karthik typed after /bureau to an action
  start        Start a preset (needs an issued start ticket)
  next         Advance a run to its next stop
  status       The status board, or one run
  approve      Approve the open gate (H tier)
  changes      Ask for changes at the open gate (H tier)
  reject       Reject at the open gate (H tier)
  resume       Resume a paused or stalled run
  pause        Pause a run at the next step boundary
  submit       Submit a session step's result
  cancel       Cancel a run (H tier)
  hook-prompt  The UserPromptSubmit hook (H tier)
  ticket       Issue a start ticket from a terminal (H tier)
  list         Recent runs
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --limit <N>        Return at most N list items (default 20; `jobs claim`: how many to claim, default 1)
      --fields <A,B>     Keep only these keys of each item, comma-separated
      --cursor <CURSOR>  Continue a truncated list from its next_cursor
  -h, --help             Print help
